WEBVTT

00:00:00.979 --> 00:00:04.149
This three-bay workshop will be issued from one saved revision.

00:00:04.149 --> 00:00:07.620
Place a 1.1 m opening in the second bay of the right wall.

00:00:07.620 --> 00:00:13.001
The jambs and header become distinct members in the model.

00:00:13.001 --> 00:00:16.004
Calculate and review this revision before issuing its coordination files.

00:00:16.004 --> 00:00:21.167
DXF writes one 3D line per member, with its mark and section. Coordinates are in metres, with elevation on Z.

00:00:21.167 --> 00:00:26.656
The quantity register gives each member's length and the basis of its steel mass.

00:00:26.656 --> 00:00:33.947
IFC4 groups the same members by section and role within the building. Their axes follow the DXF coordinates.

00:00:33.947 --> 00:00:39.568
Editing the model suspends export until the next saved calculation. Construction requires the engineer's review.
